# Summary

The bylaws state that books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws. [[cite:obs-970ed63843fd4a57e94fae8f1ea79a12b42b592e "Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws."]]

Members may keep novels for twenty-one days, and that loan is renewable twice. [[cite:obs-953224cab7851cf2dabea80855c92b9835ee979c "Novels: twenty-one days, renewable twice."]]
